 em Ortopedia Funcional dos Maxilares e mestre em Ortodontia.\n\n📍 Juazeiro do Norte – Ceará\n🦷 Aparelho ortodôntico em Juazeiro do Norte\n✨ Invisalign em Juazeiro do Norte\n💻 Escaneamento digital iTero Elements\n\nPorque cuidar do sorriso também é investir em tecnologia, precisão e excelência.\n\nSorriso Kids Family — odontologia que acompanha o futuro."}, "cta_type": "VIEW_INSTAGRAM_PROFILE", "display_format": "VIDEO", "link_description": null, "link_url": "https://instagram.com/sorrisokidsfamily", "images": [], "page_categories": ["Dentist"], "page_like_count": 891, "title": null, "videos": [{"video_hd_url": "https://video.feoh1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQOx0aTJsvx4Ts15gox30Wmzie2MXuGVakVM6XPwT_bvWHc5129S8MUgy77MPHbWWCPMQqSVnNhDO-u5MpHZF3QIIKZFi3zW80oPnHzkww.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Ado1bQvJ8XH_wW9ACvlUU_TyoSDABtVku8Pe9f2uuHQbyC8d7y7K4q80EjABTl50et7IhPYC-xCI0dqlhh2z6d93&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video.feoh1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=MJGuKdnezT4Q7kNvwG9oZyb&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLnByb2dyZXNzaXZlX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoyNzM3ODgzNzE1NTEyMDY4OCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjAsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEyMzc0LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo5LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=zUl6DGIz9WF7bv7Os3R9CQ&_nc_ss=7f289&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQH9pTZPy_Hc1vmmcjf_7LQe9mVK-Zne4Y5lRL7AFPC0Dw&oe=6A7E253D", "video_preview_image_url": "https://scontent.feoh3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/768310419_1030780136232454_3755637155260514257_n.jpg?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=18XK0UHhwY0Q7kNvwFIRG9o&_nc_oc=AdpobBFwKIxZPDCH1MVvP2OrHJca47Oazj28Pzv5IWEuQR3j9_FKox25rccpU-h8aSk1EExbPjzcJvL5OrqoJBQ_&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.feoh3-1.fna&_nc_gid=zUl6DGIz9WF7bv7Os3R9CQ&_nc_ss=7f289&oh=00_AQFb8IFExsTit2pOqHLFCoDqo5y_jXcHo4T9yfvwjnGURw&oe=6A7E3E65", "video_sd_url": "https://video.feoh3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQOuo1rS3vUJANYBKzLf8bbaGajIDAhYG9JQnpCxaED0j9WoJ6xoWEigFI5830_KUreUMu286-NMq4ajerBFzmatW6BKFo-