idado, no olhar individualizado e na construção de uma relação de confiança com cada família.\n\nSorriso Kids Family.\nOnde você cuida do sorriso e da saúde de toda a sua família. 💙\n\nOdontopediatria em Juazeiro do Norte e referência em toda a região do Cariri."}, "cta_type": "WHATSAPP_MESSAGE", "display_format": "VIDEO", "link_description": null, "link_url": "https://api.whatsapp.com/send", "images": [], "page_categories": ["Dentist"], "page_like_count": 891, "title": null, "videos": [{"video_hd_url": "https://video.feoh3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQP_VTnH5gJojcJVdS3Tp0OFM9J_nOmz3AMNsV5YryAmxXkbjsfUQQ2oib_ejCay8X_T7gJJbSFdrsFsLYss1_zblCusVB1u5jGL7R9qnA.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdqjofrjyoC6pDLJ4fK3q3yp65gQUZCxoR7syoI09GL33nsyd1mp6ioMYTBl6tK3dbD96e0Y6rqLnMY3z9f3JlzA&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video.feoh3-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=ARS9AIpJDxgQ7kNvwFFHPlS&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLnByb2dyZXNzaXZlX2gyNjQtYmFzaWMtZ2VuMl83MjBwIiwieHB2X2Fzc2V0X2lkIjoyNTMxMzcyOTk0MDQ2NTgwLCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MSwidmlfdXNlY2FzZV9pZCI6MTIzNzQsImR1cmF0aW9uX3MiOjYwLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=zUl6DGIz9WF7bv7Os3R9CQ&_nc_ss=7f289&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQHMXD38YDjRcP9zY0xGOH5U29CzdR8ovhaeaUl75xAzGg&oe=6A7E21FA", "video_preview_image_url": "https://scontent.feoh3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/767268705_4291433227814119_5342867153048439593_n.jpg?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=EOARcZqMaOEQ7kNvwFnXhtv&_nc_oc=AdqnlENt_fKoA2PfEvfwtOgXwNEoExZuHdqnvRGQtCeNBkG_8Iok8clMwfk2pp5X4V7ZXdsTENy7zjv82Vqq_vxA&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent.feoh3-1.fna&_nc_gid=zUl6DGIz9WF7bv7Os3R9CQ&_nc_ss=7f289&oh=00_AQE0fZHS-BHFantBnuRR4tNv8142SQHMOGs9jC0Pu5NwEQ&oe=6A7E3D07", "video_sd_url": "https://video.feoh3-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQNoZVBDqpIyP3OyvR7LEsASR3o8v1ThRD53SXrfchgmud0L04ieOr93vf-3FfHr7ndGT8Ochwxr9cS7twzpUwCRksxsjRcozs2osxVv6w.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Adqn7M4r1-W8Z-ETSR8iGb08jJHOHUsp6WXVlIl8IhOYm83E9-2ZMAQi7m40kHADR9oli2s_Qlf